  "text": "Silver Price in the 1970s\nBetween the first (1970-01-30) and last (1979-12-31) monthly observations available for the 1970s, the LBMA silver price went from $1.91 to $32.20 — a gain of 1584% — with a sampled high of $32.20 (Dec 1979) and a sampled low of $1.31 (Oct 1971).\nYears in the 1970s\n1970\n1971\n1972\n1973\n1974\n1975\n1976\n1977\n1978\n1979\nSee today's live silver price on the\nspot dashboard\n, or\nshop silver bullion\nat Bullion Trading LLC.\nData retrieved 2026-09-26. Latest observation for this metal: 2026-09-25. The current month is provisional.\nSources, sampling and calculation methodology\n.\nPrepared by the\nBullion Trading LLC editorial team\n.",
